1
00:00:00,442 --> 00:00:02,072
All right.

2
00:00:02,235 --> 00:00:04,195
(Sheldon(picks up train):)Let's see.

3
00:00:06,364 --> 00:00:10,164
"Bernie Bunny Has Two Daddies Now."

4
00:00:10,327 --> 00:00:13,287
That's probably
about homosexual rabbits.

5
00:00:14,372 --> 00:00:17,662
"Gerry the Gerbil
and the Bullies on the Bus."

6
00:00:17,834 --> 00:00:20,214
(Sheldon(picks up train):)Read it, not helpful.

7
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,670
Ooh. Well, here we go.

8
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:27,430
"Stu the Cockatoo is New at the Zoo."

9
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:30,100
"Author Sarah Carpenter...

10
00:00:30,263 --> 00:00:32,893
(Sheldon(picks up train):)...lives in Fort Wayne, Indiana...

11
00:00:33,058 --> 00:00:36,018
(Sheldon(picks up train):)...with her husband
and best friend, Mark...

12
00:00:36,186 --> 00:00:38,106
...and their cockatoo, Stu."

13
00:00:39,356 --> 00:00:42,646
(Sheldon(picks up train):)Hardly makes her an expert
in making friends, wouldn't you agree?

14
00:00:42,817 --> 00:00:44,907
(Little girl:)I don't like birds. They scare me.

15
00:00:45,779 --> 00:00:47,819
(Sheldon:)Me too.

16
00:00:48,782 --> 00:00:51,412
(Sheldon:)Most people don't see it.

17
00:00:53,578 --> 00:00:54,708
(Sheldon:)What are you reading?

18
00:00:54,871 --> 00:00:56,041
(Girl:)Curious George.

19
00:00:56,206 --> 00:00:57,836
(Sheldon:)Oh, I do like monkeys.

